OL,3,ADrone strike by Sudan paramilitary
OL,4,Akills 41 near Ethiopian border, rights
OL,5,Agroup says
OL,6,
OL,7,FA drone attack by Sudan's paramilitary
OL,8,Fforces has killed 41 people in the
OL,9,Fcountry's Blue Nile region bordering
OL,10,FEthiopia, a rights group has said.
OL,12,FThe strike by the Rapid Support Forces
OL,13,F(RSF) targeted a camp for displaced
OL,14,Fpeople in the state's Abu Shandi area
OL,15,Fon Friday, Emergency Lawyers said.
OL,17,FThe UN Office for the Co-ordination of
OL,18,FHumanitarian Affairs (Ocha) said it was
OL,19,F"appalled by horrifying reports". It
OL,20,Fsaid initial reports suggested most of
OL,21,Fthe casualties were women and children.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
