OL,3,ADrone strike by Sudan paramilitary
OL,4,Akills 41 near Ethiopian border, rights
OL,5,Agroup says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Sudanese army and paramilitary
OL,8,Fforces including the RSF have been
OL,9,Flocked in a power struggle since 2023,
OL,10,Fa conflict that has killed hundreds of
OL,11,Fthousands and displaced more than 14
OL,12,Fmillion from their homes.
